            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "nah dog person lol"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "haha i can see that, dogs are way more loyal. what kinda dog would be your dream one"
            },
            {
              "who": "fan",
              "text": "golden retriever or sumthin idk"
            },
            {
              "who": "creator",
              "text": "haha classic choice, all that energy sounds fun. whatcha up to rn tho"
            },
            {
